From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] nl80211: match the scan timeout to its native BSS owner

A shared driver can have several BSS scan links. Match the timeout context
before aborting so another interface's scan is not selected.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---

--- a/src/drivers/driver_nl80211_scan.c
+++ b/src/drivers/driver_nl80211_scan.c
@@ -164,7 +164,7 @@
 #endif /* CONFIG_DRIVER_NL80211_QCA */
 
 	for (bss = drv->first_bss; bss; bss = bss->next) {
-		if (bss->scan_link)
+		if (bss->scan_link && bss->ctx == timeout_ctx)
 			break;
 	}
 
